    <item>
      <title>Squeak 2.23.3</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:26:44 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>22303</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.23.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>html{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#18181b;background:transparent;margin:0;padding:4px 2px}ul{margin:0 0 10px;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 10px}h4{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#52525b;margin:16px 0 6px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)}code{font:12px ui-monospace,'SF Mono',monospace;background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:6px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f4f4f5}h4{color:#a1a1aa;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}code{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}}</style></head><body><ul><li>Fixes the background service never starting on a new Mac. It now starts in under a second instead of quietly exiting.</li><li>Setup shows each stage of the first start and waits patiently on Macs with security software, instead of giving up and undoing the install.</li><li>Fixes a crash on Macs that don't have Conductor installed.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.23.2</h4><ul><li>If setup can't start the background service, Squeak says why and offers Send report with the details attached (secrets removed).</li><li>Reporting a problem is easier everywhere: a Report button beside every Try again, a gentle offer when something fails, and reports know your Squeak account so the team can reply.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.23.1</h4><ul><li>Setup on a new Mac no longer hangs on starting the background service. It asks to run in the background first, says what it is doing at each step, and if something goes wrong it tells you why with Try again, Copy details and Show log.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
